{"version":1,"content":"<p>新加坡歌手巫啟賢的恩師劉文正當年慧眼識英雄，早於80年代簽下巫啟賢，並帶他進軍華語歌壇。</p><p>最近，巫啟賢接受台媒訪問，被問到恩師的近況，巫啟賢除了駁斥其死訊，還暖心地送上滿滿的祝福。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;巫啟賢提到多年前接</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T20:15:02.566288+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T20:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T20:08:16.468551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T20:08:16.468551+00:00","content_hash":"bad7606f68fec360268c8f374fc455dd37543f6c19a2d58d7d4dcb1633054bbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}